:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Heavy Assault C.A.T. (Enemy)]].''
The '''Cats in a Box''' are a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[Version 1.0 Update|Version 1.0]] and can be purchased for 90 [[Cat Food]] in the [[Upgrade Menu]] after completing [[Egypt (Empire of Cats)|Egypt]] in [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 3.3 Update|Version 3.3]] reduces movement speed, but increases range and gains the ability to [[Weaken|weaken]] [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemies. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.0 Update|Version 10.0]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], they're obtained in Mie and cost 13000 XP. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], they're unlocked from clearing Egypt in the Empire of Cats chapter and cost 45 Cat Food.

