==Trivia==
*[[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]] gave Heavy Assault C.A.T. the ability to [[Weaken]] [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]].
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Heavy Assault C.A.T. was a part of another [[Cat Combo]] called [[Helmetheads (Removed Combo)|Helmetheads]].
*All the forms have small "[[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]]" text on the bottom-left of the right side of the box. It might not be visible in Evolved Form, but you can just about see part of the text behind one of the wheels.
*In the Taiwanese version, Cats in a Box do not have text "バナナ" (banana) on their box. The "みかん" (mikan, "orange") text on Cat Gang's box was also removed in this version.
*In the [[The Battle Cats|English version]], Heavy Assault C.A.T. is missing the text in the front that is present in [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]].
*Heavy Assault C.A.T. resembles the [[wikia:starwars:All Terrain Scout Transport|AT-ST]] from ''Star Wars''.
*Cat Gang's spritesheet has unused sprites for legs, implying that they might have originally been intended to run on 2 legs instead of driving on wheels.
*In The Battle Cats Unite!, Cats in a Box still has its True Form available and can be playable, however, it requires the use of save file editing for it to be accessed.
*Prior to [[Version 15.6 Update|Version 15.6]], Cats in a Box's descriptions read as follows:
<pre>Cats in a Box
These poor guys have been abandoned.
They are now fending for themselves
with GREAT JUSTICE and speed (Area Attack)</pre>
<pre>Cat Gang
The hard life turned them towards
the wild side. We should avoid them now.
Who knows what they'll do (Area Attack)</pre>
<pre>Heavy Assault C.A.T.
An elite unit who keep the peace by rushing
at the enemies of society. Might weaken
Dark enemy attacks (Area Attack)</pre>

